※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4457

※ There is one index per dimension, in the order the shape was written in.
※ Fewer would name a row rather than an element, which is a thing this language
※ does not yet take out of an array, and more would name a dimension the array
※ does not have.

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let m: u8⟦2,3⟧ = ⟦⟦1u8,2u8,3u8⟧,⟦4u8,5u8,6u8⟧⟧
    m⟦1⟧
